  "articleHtml": "<main>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Bolthouse Farms products can look similar on the shelf while having very different nutrition profiles. A fruit smoothie, carrot juice, Protein Plus shake, and refrigerated dressing are designed for completely different uses, so comparing them by calories alone can be misleading.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Use the\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Bolthouse Farms Nutrition Calculator above\n    </span>\n<span>\n     to find a specific product and check its calories, protein, carbohydrates, sugar, fat, sodium, and other available nutrition values.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.1lb4ly6sko0\">\n<span>\n     Start With the Product Type\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The quickest way to understand Bolthouse Farms nutrition is to first identify what kind of product you are looking at.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A juice or fruit smoothie may get most of its calories from carbohydrates and naturally occurring or added sugars.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Protein Plus\n    </span>\n<span>\n     drink has a different balance because protein contributes a much larger part of its nutrition.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Dressings are different again, with fat and sodium often playing a larger role than they do in many beverages.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     That is why there is no meaningful single answer to \u201cHow many calories are in Bolthouse Farms?\u201d The specific product and serving size matter.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.4ubmxjle3r3b\">\n<span>\n     Smoothies and Juices Can Differ More Than Their Names Suggest\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Bolthouse Farms offers fruit blends, vegetable juices, green smoothies, functional beverages, and other bottled drinks.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Even two fruit-based drinks can have noticeably different amounts of:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Calories\n     <br/>\n     Total carbohydrates\n     <br/>\n     Sugar\n     <br/>\n     Fiber\n     <br/>\n     Protein\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     For example, a carrot-based juice should not be compared as if it were nutritionally identical to Green Goodness, a strawberry-banana smoothie, or a mango-based blend.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Search the exact product name in the calculator rather than using one Bolthouse smoothie as a substitute for another.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.ck77srr6hiqz\">\n<span>\n     Check Sugar Together With the Ingredient List\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Sugar is one of the most commonly searched nutrients for bottled smoothies and juices, but the number needs context.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Bolthouse Farms states that many of its beverages contain\n    </span>\n<span>\n     no added sugars and are naturally sweetened by fruits and vegetables\n    </span>\n<span>\n     , while certain product lines do contain added sugar.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     This means two drinks with similar total sugar can still differ in where that sugar comes from.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     When that distinction matters to you, check both the nutrition facts and the current ingredient label for the exact bottle.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.eg6aqpjczz9r\">\n<span>\n     Protein Plus Drinks Are a Separate Category\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Bolthouse Farms Protein Plus drinks are designed with substantially more protein than standard juices and many fruit smoothies.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     For example, products in the current NutritionSolver database include Protein Plus varieties with much higher protein totals than drinks such as carrot juice or Green Goodness.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     When comparing these products, look at the full balance:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Protein relative to calories\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Carbohydrates and sugar\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Total fat\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Serving size\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A higher protein number does not mean two shakes are otherwise nutritionally identical.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.f58blxma7x80\">\n<span>\n     Serving Size Matters With Bottled Drinks\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Always match the nutrition information to the\n    </span>\n<span>\n     specific bottle and serving size\n    </span>\n<span>\n     you are consuming.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Bolthouse Farms sells different products and package sizes, so one bottle should not automatically be assumed to have the same serving amount as another.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If your product label differs from the entry in the calculator, use the current package label for the most product-specific information.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     This is especially important when comparing older and newer versions of a drink because formulas, bottle sizes, and nutrition labels can change over time.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.evy99eqdrpk8\">\n<span>\n     Dressings Need a Different Comparison\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Bolthouse Farms also makes refrigerated dressings, including Ranch, Caesar, Blue Cheese, Honey Mustard, vinaigrettes, and other varieties.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     For dressings, a small serving can contribute meaningful amounts of\n    </span>\n<span>\n     fat and sodium\n    </span>\n<span>\n     , even when the calorie number appears modest.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If you are comparing two dressings, check:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"space-y-2 mb-6 ml-4 list-disc list-inside text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base\">\n<li class=\"leading-relaxed text-zinc-300\">\n<span>\n      Calories per serving\n     </span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"leading-relaxed text-zinc-300\">\n<span>\n      Total fat\n     </span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"leading-relaxed text-zinc-300\">\n<span>\n      Saturated fat\n     </span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"leading-relaxed text-zinc-300\">\n<span>\n      Sodium\n     </span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"leading-relaxed text-zinc-300\">\n<span>\n      Carbohydrates and sugars\n     </span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     And if you use more than the listed serving, adjust the nutrition accordingly.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.ifjdti41yxoe\">\n<span>\n     Bolthouse Farms Also Includes Carrot Products\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Bolthouse Farms has deep roots in carrot farming, so not every item associated with the brand is a smoothie or dressing.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If you are looking at baby carrots or another carrot product, compare it as a whole food rather than against bottled drinks.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Keeping carrots, beverages, protein shakes, and dressings in separate categories makes the nutrition database easier to understand and prevents unlike products from being compared as if they served the same purpose.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.5uqes497y03u\">\n<span>\n     Bolthouse Farms Nutrition Questions\n    </span>\n</h2><div class=\"faq-accordion-container space-y-3 my-6\"><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>How many calories are in a Bolthouse Farms smoothie?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Are Bolthouse Farms smoothies high in sugar?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Which Bolthouse Farms drinks have the most protein?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Is Green Goodness the same nutritionally as carrot juice?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Do Bolthouse Farms dressings have the same serving size as beverages?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details></div>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.6haghsvg8qu\">\n<span>\n     About the Bolthouse Farms Nutrition Data\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     NutritionSolver organizes available\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Bolthouse Farms nutrition facts\n    </span>\n<span>\n     across beverages, smoothies, protein drinks, dressings, and carrot products so you can compare items without searching through individual product labels.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     For branded packaged foods and drinks, the latest\n    </span>\n<span>\n     official Bolthouse Farms product label\n    </span>\n<span>\n     should remain the primary reference because recipes, serving sizes, and product availability can change.\n    </span>\n</p>\n</main>",
